  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0116_00ede8d3be30.png\" style=\"width: 263px; height: 200px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>Re</mo><mfenced><mi>&#969;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>For min&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>Re</mi><mfenced><mi>&#969;</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></msup></math></p><p>For real and minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>"
